Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear through the storm and blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine, hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You who know the heart of justice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,become the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning fiercely in your heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,unleash your courage and love!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:01:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's set fire on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your life on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Thunder! Never surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear through the storm and blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the fighting spirit surging through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let tomorrow slip away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.18,0:01:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear through the storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Race on, Thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a challenger!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rising up amid the storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,you are the warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:01:53.00,Note,,0,0,0,,Draft lyric translation
